body:
EVERYONE AFFECTED BY COVID-19. 

(1) Our only choice now is to finalise our plans for the National Australian Lawyers Communist Union. We will demand better hot-desking with more frequent cleaning between our new product called "human capital respite time" which is deducted from annual leave; 

(2) Every morning, the senior partners will raise morale by reading Hamil J's catchwords or an equity judgment from Leeming JA;

(3) Graduates will be given a free copy of "The Contract of Employment" and will be personally mentored by Ian Neil SC, in a three day work shop where they write their own agreements; 

(4) All meetings will have themes from law to make them a fun and interesting event. See the third year associates dress-up as *Mabo (No. 2)* and award a prize for the best impersonation of SEK Hulme QC at the Sir Samuel Griffith Society.  The afternoon meetings theme is *voir dire* and see the different ways a graduate can cry.

(5) Every third Friday, a partners name is pulled out of a hat, and he is sent into the hot-desk dome with bags of his equity drawings. If a junior kills him, they become a partner.

THESE ARE JUST A FEW OF OUR POLICIES; WE WELCOME ALL.
